description	"Sith Trooper

Adaptable soldiers who may specialize in Saber prowess, elemental weapons, and more.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Vibrosaber
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- No Blaster Block
-- Lightweight
> Vibrosword (Yellow)
-- 5% shorter
> Vibrostaff (Staff)
-- 19% longer
- Sith Blaster Pistol (1)
-- Mag reload

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (0)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"